  (885, 'R-2D', 8.712, NULL, NULL, 'https://library.municode.com/fl/port_orange/codes/land_development_code?nodeId=LADECO_CH17ZODIRE_S27SCDIRE', 'VERIFIED via direct Municode backend API fetch (api.municode.com/CodesContent, ClientID 3932, productId 12297). Sec.27 table row for R-2D confirmed: Minimum Lot Area/D.U. = ''5,000 sq. ft.'', Minimum Lot Width = ''50/D.U.'' (matches researcher''s cited ''50/D.U.'' width figure exactly). 43,560/5,000 = 8.712 du/acre matches exactly. Original researcher note fully accurate.', 0.9, '2026-07-24'),
